Hi Michael,

On Fri, 23 Jun 2006, Michael Frey wrote:

> Does anyone know how to put a CSR Bluecore chip into continuous  
> transmit mode using hcitool?
> 
You can not do that using HCI Tool because this is a CSR specific 
low level testing command (may be you can figure our the necessary command 
sequence, but this will be very complicated). 

And as far as I know also the bccmd tool does not support CSR RF test 
commands. 

